{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368398918,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8b0e6130013Oc6m0J2iNyV5M","messageID":"msg_1c8b0caa9001iV41KEtnZpIKCQ","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>npm registry is reachable (tailwindcss 4.3.5 available). pip download to /tmp/opencode failed due to permission (mkdir denied?). Let me try installing flask in a venv inside /workspace or check pip's cache. Let's try `pip download` into /workspace/.tmp or check if pip install works with a cache.\n\nLet me create a venv in the workspace (gitignored? .gitignore may not exist). I'll create it in /workspace/.venv — the .dockerignore excludes .venv. But it would show up in git status. I'll clean it up at the end, or keep it (there's no .gitignore in the workspace... let me check).\n\nLet me check pip install into avenv.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794368398867,"end":1794368398904}}}
