{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368834104,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8b78a2b001JaXEKTMNh4c0t0","messageID":"msg_1c8b756350010swrH6gHS5GlGs","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>The failure: after hiding bob's top score (300), the leaderboard still shows bob with 120. That's actually correct behavior! Bob has another visible score of 120, so bob still appears on the leaderboard with his best *visible* score of 120. My test expectation was wrong (I expected total 1). The implementation is right: hidden scores are excluded, but the player still appears with their next best visible score.\n\nWait, but then \"hidden score leaves best score\" check said best_score == 120 — correct.\n\nSo the leaderboard after hiding should be: alice 250 (rank 1), bob 120 (rank 2) → total 2. My test expectation was wrong. Let me fix the test.\n\nLet me update the test to expect total 2 with bob's score 120 and rank 2.\n\nAlso I should test the case where a hidden score is the player's ONLY score → the player disappears from the leaderboard.\n\nLetme update the smoke test.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794368834091,"end":1794368834102}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794368834131,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_01a1c8b75fed75538724ff79","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py","newString":"        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n        check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][1][\"score\"] == 120, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/scores\", token=bob)\n        check(\"hidden score leaves best score\", payload[\"best_score\"] == 120, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n        check(\"toggle again shows\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is False, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n        check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"score\"] == 300, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"POST\", \"/api/admin/scores/9999/toggle\", token=admin)\n        check(\"toggle unknown -> 404\", status == 404, payload)\n\n        # a player whose only score is hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n        solo = call(\"POST\", \"/api/scores\", {\"score\": 42}, token=bob)[1][\"id\"]\n        call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard?player=bob\")\n        check(\"only hidden score -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 0, payload)\n        call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)","oldString":"        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n        check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 1 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"player\"] == \"alice\", payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/scores\", token=bob)\n        check(\"hidden score leaves best score\", payload[\"best_score\"] == 120, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n        check(\"toggle again shows\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is False, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n        check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2, payload)\n        status, payload = call(\"POST\", \"/api/admin/scores/9999/toggle\", token=admin)\n        check(\"toggle unknown -> 404\", status == 404, payload)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n+++ /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n@@ -194,18 +194,25 @@\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle -> 200\", status == 200, payload)\n check(\"toggle hides\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is True, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n-check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 1 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"player\"] == \"alice\", payload)\n+check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][1][\"score\"] == 120, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/scores\", token=bob)\n check(\"hidden score leaves best score\", payload[\"best_score\"] == 120, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle again shows\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is False, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n-check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2, payload)\n+check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"score\"] == 300, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", \"/api/admin/scores/9999/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle unknown -> 404\", status == 404, payload)\n \n+# a player whose only score is hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n+solo = call(\"POST\", \"/api/scores\", {\"score\": 42}, token=bob)[1][\"id\"]\n+call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n+status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard?player=bob\")\n+check(\"only hidden score -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 0, payload)\n+call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n+\n print(\"me\")\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/auth/me\", token=admin)\n check(\"me admin\", status == 200 and payload[\"username\"] == \"admin\" and payload[\"is_admin\"] is True, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/auth/me\", token=alice)\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n+++ /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n@@ -194,18 +194,25 @@\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle -> 200\", status == 200, payload)\n check(\"toggle hides\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is True, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n-check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 1 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"player\"] == \"alice\", payload)\n+check(\"hidden score leaves leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][1][\"score\"] == 120, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/scores\", token=bob)\n check(\"hidden score leaves best score\", payload[\"best_score\"] == 120, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{top['id']}/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle again shows\", payload.get(\"is_hidden\") is False, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n-check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2, payload)\n+check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"score\"] == 300, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", \"/api/admin/scores/9999/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle unknown -> 404\", status == 404, payload)\n \n+# a player whose only score is hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n+solo = call(\"POST\", \"/api/scores\", {\"score\": 42}, token=bob)[1][\"id\"]\n+call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n+status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard?player=bob\")\n+check(\"only hidden score -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 0, payload)\n+call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n+\n print(\"me\")\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/auth/me\", token=admin)\n check(\"me admin\", status == 200 and payload[\"username\"] == \"admin\" and payload[\"is_admin\"] is True, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/auth/me\", token=alice)\n","additions":9,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":".tmp/smoke.py","time":{"start":1794368834099,"end":1794368834112}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8b78a2e001AUsRWxSuqiUeI4","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","messageID":"msg_1c8b756350010swrH6gHS5GlGs"}}
