{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368838489,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8b79b480019cJk1DMhpGhIEc","messageID":"msg_1c8b78a4e001MiqGT2hkJABL6K","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>Wait, there's an issue with the \"only hidden score -> player gone\" test: bob still has the score 120 visible, so hiding score 42 (solo) won't remove bob from the leaderboard. I need to hide all of bob's scores. Let me restructure: hide bob's 300 and 120 as well.\n\nSimpler: after the toggle test, hide all bob's scores (loop over admin scores filtered by player == 'bob'), then check bob is gone. Let me rewrite that block.\n\nAlso careful: the admin list returns items with 'player'.\n\nLet me rewrite: after the \"shown score back\" check, hide all bob scores:\n\n```python\nbob_ids = [s[\"id\"] for s in call(\"GET\", \"/api/admin/scores\", token=admin)[1][\"items\"] if s[\"player\"] == \"bob\"]\nfor sid in bob_ids:\n    call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{sid}/toggle\", token=admin)\nstatus, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\ncheck(\"all scores hidden -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 1 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"player\"] == \"alice\", payload)\nfor sid in bob_ids:\n    call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{sid}/toggle\", token=admin)\n```\n\nThat's a bettertest.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794368838472,"end":1794368838486}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794368838519,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_01a1c8b794e27127a5228fa1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py","newString":"        # a player whose scores are all hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n        bob_ids = [s[\"id\"] for s in call(\"GET\", \"/api/admin/scores\", token=admin)[1][\"items\"] if s[\"player\"] == \"bob\"]\n        for sid in bob_ids:\n            call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{sid}/toggle\", token=admin)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard\")\n        check(\"all scores hidden -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 1 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"player\"] == \"alice\", payload)\n        for sid in bob_ids:\n            call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{sid}/toggle\", token=admin)","oldString":"        # a player whose only score is hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n        solo = call(\"POST\", \"/api/scores\", {\"score\": 42}, token=bob)[1][\"id\"]\n        call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)\n        status, payload = call(\"GET\", \"/api/leaderboard?player=bob\")\n        check(\"only hidden score -> player gone\", payload[\"total\"] == 0, payload)\n        call(\"POST\", f\"/api/admin/scores/{solo}/toggle\", token=admin)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n+++ /workspace/.tmp/smoke.py\n@@ -204,14 +204,16 @@\n check(\"shown score back on leaderboard\", payload[\"total\"] == 2 and payload[\"items\"][0][\"score\"] == 300, payload)\n status, payload = call(\"POST\", \"/api/admin/scores/9999/toggle\", token=admin)\n check(\"toggle unknown -> 404\", status == 404, payload)\n \n-# a player whose only score is hidden disappears from the leaderboard\n-solo = call(\"POST\", \"