{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368887707,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8b85b4f001Zu6BVJgoQtanf5","messageID":"msg_1c8b84a2b001vpXLLsiF0ztDxP","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>Backend is solid. Now the frontend.\n\nTodo update: mark backend complete, start Tailwind setup.\n\nFrontend plan:\n1. `npm install -D tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite` (+ typescript, @types/react, @types/react-dom).\n2. vite.config.ts: add the tailwindcss plugin.\n3. src/index.css: `@import \"tailwindcss\";`\n4. Components.\n\nLet me first install the deps.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794368887631,"end":1794368887654}}}
