{"type":"text","timestamp":1794369106753,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8bbb326001vbZMdYsvpsCWPy","messageID":"msg_1c8bba3eb001WMxWH8QM8yGxMF","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>The build works and the CSS is 23KB (Tailwind utilities are being generated).\n\nLet me verify the Tailwind classes are present in the built CSS (e.g. check for a distinctive class like \"bg-slate-900/60\" or \"text-amber-300\").\n\nThen I need to test the frontend end-to-end against the backend. I can't run a browser easily... Let me check if a headless browser is available (playwright/puppeteer?). Probably not. I can at least verify:\n1. The built index.html is served by Flask.\n2. The API works via the same origin.\n\nFor a UI sanity check, I could do a quick DOM-based test with a headless browser if available. Let me check for chromium/playwright.\n\nLet me first check the CSS content and then test the served app withcurl.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794369106727,"end":1794369106748}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794369106950,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c8bbad9170379d062cf9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend/dist && ls -R | head -20 && grep -c \"amber\" assets/*.css && grep -o \"bg-slate-900\\\\\\\\/60\" assets/*.css | head -2; which chromium chromium-browser google-chrome 2>/dev/null; python3 -c \"import playwright\" 2>&1 | tail -1"},"output":".:\nassets\nindex.html\n\n./assets:\nindex-BOSwvPm-.js\nindex-Cv8Npzm8.css\n1\nbg-slate-900\\/60\nbg-slate-900\\/60\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'playwright'\n","metadata":{"output":".:\nassets\nindex.html\n\n./assets:\nindex-BOSwvPm-.js\nindex-Cv8Npzm8.css\n1\nbg-slate-900\\/60\nbg-slate-900\\/60\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'playwright'\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/frontend/dist && ls -R | head -20 && grep -c \"amber\" assets/*.css && grep -o \"bg-slate-900\\\\\\\\/60\" assets/*.css | head -2; which chromium chromium-browser google-chrome 2>/dev/null; python3 -c \"import playwright\" 2>&1 | tail -1","time":{"start":1794369106737,"end":1794369106877}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8bbb329001oUztwRjElrVPjR","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","messageID":"msg_1c8bba3eb001WMxWH8QM8yGxMF"}}
