{"type":"text","timestamp":1794369364546,"sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8bfa230001y0QDjpErXOp1RP","messageID":"msg_1c8bf88b3001Oc5EbnB8WilpAU","sessionID":"ses_e3750b618ffeN46LwuGHIvwVmz","type":"text","text":"<think>Two failures:\n1. \"signs a player in and submits a score\" — need details.\n2. \"lets the admin hide a score\" — \"Unable to find text 999999\" — the admin panel didn't render the score row. Possibly because `formatNumber(999999)` → \"999,999\" (toLocaleString adds a thousands separator!). So the text is \"999,999\" not \"999999\". That's my test's fault (and a good catch: the admin table displays formatted numbers).\n\nLet me fix the test to look for \"999,999\".\n\nFor failure 1, let me see the fullerror.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794369364528,"end":1794369364543}}}
